{"id":"b782710fac9440e0","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-congruence-generated.md","title":"Generated Congruence","display":"Generated Congruence","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-congruence-generated","aliases":["93-lem-congruence-generated"],"display":"Generated Congruence","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-congruence-lattice]]","[[93-prop-generated-congruence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-congruence-generated"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-congruence-generated</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Generated Congruence"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" href=\"?note=135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" title=\"93-df-congruence-lattice\">93-df-congruence-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bc6be798712f24f2\" href=\"?note=bc6be798712f24f2\" title=\"93-prop-generated-congruence\">93-prop-generated-congruence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-congruence-generated---Generated-Congruence\">lem-congruence-generated - Generated Congruence</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|^2\">\\(R\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|^2\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> is the congruence lattice of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cg}^{\\mathbf A}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cg}^{\\mathbf A}(R)\\)</span> is the sourced generated congruence of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" href=\"?note=135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" title=\"93-df-congruence-lattice\">93-df-congruence-lattice</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land R\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|^2\\to\\mathrm{Cg}^{\\mathbf A}(R)=\\bigcap\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):R\\subseteq\\theta\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land R\\subseteq|\\mathbf A|^2\\to\\mathrm{Cg}^{\\mathbf A}(R)=\\bigcap\\{\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):R\\subseteq\\theta\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Generated congruences are intersections of all congruences containing the given relation.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-congruence-generated---Generated-Congruence","text":"lem-congruence-generated - Generated Congruence","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30